    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "c2af7b9dfe234d2e9354b530426c102e",
    "m_Title": "Part 6: danger mode",
    "m_Content": "Swapped in on Space by DangerMode.cs in place of the Horror Post. A heartbeat (lub-dub at Heart Rate) tightens a blood-red watercolour vignette, spikes chromatic aberration and flashes the frame; everything but reds drains to cold grey.",
